ex:TK8_BuildPage_Ch19 backlog:hasState backlog:InProgress ; backlog:hasAuditNote "Page 9.97.0 (03-materials/ch19/page/sen0414_ch19_page_v9_97_0.html) built from the lambda-free A-box 1.0.7, page data recorded under Pyodide 0.28.2 (Python 3.13.2). Checks: material check 7 of 8 pass (code-in-page, code-parses, no-prompts, notes, titles pass); no-lambda fails only on 10 template-owned occurrences (syntax highlighter and glossary text), none in any learner-visible code; manifest self-check passes. Page test: 68 features pass, 2 fail because the browser tab crashes at the same step in two runs (it loads and idles fine); cause not yet found, so this task is not Done. Open: stand-in note shows on 0 examples; 31 concept examples are recorded only, not runnable." .
